//@version=6
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//                        L I Q U I D I T Y   B R E A K O U T   M A T R I X   ( L B M )
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
//  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
//  │  A U T H O R   V E R I F I C A T I O N                                                  │
//  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
//  Script Name        : Liquidity Breakout Matrix
//  Short Title        : LBM
//  Author             : Forex_Market_Insights
//  Original Developer : Forex_Market_Insights
//  Copyright          : © Forex_Market_Insights
//  Pine Version       : v6
//  Script Type        : Overlay indicator (plots directly on the price chart)
//  Build              : 2.0 — persistent channels + Universal Activity Engine
//
//  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
//  │  D E C L A R A T I O N   O F   O R I G I N A L I T Y                                    │
//  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
//  I, Forex_Market_Insights, declare that this script is an ORIGINAL IMPLEMENTATION written
//  from scratch by me. Every calculation block below — the Compression Index, the squeeze
//  state machine, the retroactive channel construction, the ATR edge-zone model, the Universal
//  Activity Engine (real / external / synthetic volume resolution), the estimated buy-sell
//  split, the pressure gauge and the body-confirmed breakout filter — was designed, coded and
//  tested by Forex_Market_Insights.
//
//  This script does NOT copy, port, decompile, translate or re-skin any other author's
//  published or protected code. Where the underlying market CONCEPTS are common technical
//  analysis knowledge (volatility contraction, consolidation ranges, supply/demand edges,
//  range breakouts, volume-at-price), they are expressed here through my own formulas and my
//  own code architecture, which differ materially from any third-party implementation.
//
//  No built-in indicator is simply re-wrapped and no open-source script is re-published under
//  a new name. Standard Pine built-ins (ta.atr, ta.tr, ta.stdev, ta.highest, ta.lowest,
//  ta.percentrank) are used only as low-level mathematical primitives inside my own composite
//  engine.
//
//  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
//  │  W H A T   T H I S   I N D I C A T O R   D O E S                                        │
//  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
//  LBM finds the phases where price stops trending and coils inside a tight liquidity pocket,
//  draws that pocket as a channel, and then marks the moment price escapes it.
//
//  1) COMPRESSION ENGINE
//     • Price is normalized to a 0-1 structural position inside its own rolling high/low range,
//       so the engine reads structure instead of raw price and behaves identically on gold,
//       indices, FX, crypto or stocks, on any timeframe.
//     • The dispersion (standard deviation) of that normalized position measures how much price
//       is actually travelling inside its own range.
//     • An independent read compares fast ATR against slow ATR to measure raw volatility decay.
//     • Both reads are converted to rolling percentile ranks and blended into one Compression
//       Index (0-100). High = market coiling, low = market expanding.
//
//  2) SQUEEZE STATE MACHINE
//     While the Compression Index holds above threshold the squeeze duration is counted. When
//     compression is released and the squeeze lasted at least the minimum bar count, the whole
//     completed consolidation is converted into a channel. Short meaningless coils are filtered.
//
//  3) CHANNEL CONSTRUCTION (drawn retroactively over the exact coil bars)
//     • Main channel box  → highest high to lowest low of the coil
//     • Upper edge zone   → ATR-sized band under the top (supply / rejection pocket)
//     • Lower edge zone   → ATR-sized band above the bottom (demand / support pocket)
//     • Dashed equilibrium line at 50% of the range
//     The channel keeps extending right while price stays trapped, then FREEZES on the chart at
//     the breakout bar so the full history of every pocket stays readable.
//
//  4) UNIVERSAL ACTIVITY ENGINE  (works on every market, including feeds with no volume)
//     Many spot FX / CFD / metals feeds publish no traded volume. Instead of disabling half the
//     tool, LBM resolves an activity series automatically, in this priority:
//       (a) Real chart volume, when the feed actually publishes it.
//       (b) An external reference symbol you choose (e.g. a futures contract for the same asset).
//       (c) Synthetic Activity — my own proxy built from true range relative to ATR, weighted by
//           candle body efficiency. This is a participation estimate, NOT traded volume, and the
//           panel always labels it as estimated so nothing is presented as real exchange data.
//     Whichever source is resolved is then split into estimated buy / sell pressure using where
//     each candle closed inside its own range, weighted by that bar's activity.
//
//  5) FLOW OVERLAY
//     Inside the channel, per-bar estimated buy pressure is drawn above the equilibrium and sell
//     pressure below it. Modes: Comparison (buy up / sell down), Total (symmetric activity) and
//     Delta (net only). A tag prints total buy / sell for the whole coil.
//
//  6) BREAKOUT ENGINE
//     A breakout registers when price resolves outside the channel. With "Body Confirmed
//     Breakout" on (default) the midpoint of the candle body must clear the boundary, so a lone
//     wick poke is ignored. On a valid break the channel freezes and an arrow prints: ▲ upside,
//     ▼ downside.
//
//  7) PRESSURE GAUGE + INFO PANEL
//     While a channel is unresolved a vertical red→green gauge is projected right of price with
//     a ◀ pointer showing where net flow sits between the pocket's own extremes. The info panel
//     reports the active activity source, live Compression Index, squeeze state and channel size.
//
//  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
//  │  H O W   T O   U S E                                                                    │
//  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
//  • Read the channel as a liquidity pocket: the top edge holds resting sell-side orders, the
//    bottom edge holds resting buy-side orders.
//  • Wait for the resolution, trade with the arrow, and use the opposite edge zone of the broken
//    channel as invalidation.
//  • A break that immediately returns inside the channel is a failed resolution and often runs
//    hard toward the opposite edge instead.
//  • Sensitivity preset controls how many channels appear. High = more channels on fast charts,
//    Low = only the heaviest compressions. Custom unlocks the manual engine inputs.
//
//  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
//  │  R E P A I N T I N G   S T A T E M E N T                                                │
//  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
//  Channels are created only after a squeeze is confirmed finished, and once frozen they never
//  move. Breakout arrows are evaluated on live bars; enable "Wait For Bar Close" to confirm them
//  only on closed bars. External-symbol activity is requested on the chart timeframe without
//  lookahead.
//
//  DISCLAIMER: This tool is for market study and education only. It is not financial advice and
//  no signal guarantees any outcome. Trade at your own risk.
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

indicator("Liquidity Breakout Matrix", "LBM", overlay = true, max_boxes_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_bars_back = 1000)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  I N P U T S
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
gEng = "═════  COMPRESSION ENGINE  ═════"
preset    = input.string("Medium", "Sensitivity Preset", options = ["High", "Medium", "Low", "Custom"], group = gEng, tooltip = "High = more channels, Low = only the heaviest compressions. Choose Custom to use the manual values below.")
normLen   = input.int(100,  "Normalization Lookback",   minval = 10,  maxval = 500, group = gEng)
dispLen   = input.int(14,   "Dispersion Length",        minval = 2,   maxval = 100, group = gEng)
rankLen   = input.int(50,   "Percentile Window",        minval = 10,  maxval = 300, group = gEng)
compThrIn = input.int(60,   "Compression Threshold",    minval = 5,   maxval = 99,  group = gEng)
minBarsIn = input.int(8,    "Minimum Range Bars",       minval = 3,   maxval = 200, group = gEng)
dispW     = input.float(0.6,"Dispersion Weight",        minval = 0,   maxval = 1, step = 0.05, group = gEng)
atrFastL  = input.int(10,   "Fast ATR Length",          minval = 2,   group = gEng)
atrSlowL  = input.int(50,   "Slow ATR Length",          minval = 5,   group = gEng)
maxBars   = input.int(400,  "Maximum Range Bars",       minval = 20,  maxval = 900, group = gEng)

gCh = "═════  CHANNEL & ZONES  ═════"
showCh    = input.bool(true,  "Show Channels",               group = gCh)
keepBrk   = input.bool(true,  "Keep Channel After Breakout", group = gCh, tooltip = "ON = broken channels stay frozen on the chart (full history). OFF = channel disappears on breakout.")
zoneMult  = input.float(0.5,  "Edge Zone Size (x ATR)",      minval = 0.05, maxval = 3, step = 0.05, group = gCh)
zoneCap   = input.float(0.35, "Edge Zone Max (x Range)",     minval = 0.05, maxval = 0.5, step = 0.05, group = gCh)
showMid   = input.bool(true,  "Show Equilibrium Line",       group = gCh)
maxKeep   = input.int(30,     "Max Channels On Chart",       minval = 1, maxval = 120, group = gCh)

gSig = "═════  BREAKOUT ENGINE  ═════"
showArr   = input.bool(true,  "Show Breakout Arrows",    group = gSig)
strongOn  = input.bool(true,  "Body Confirmed Breakout", group = gSig, tooltip = "ON  : midpoint of the candle body must clear the edge (wick pokes ignored).\nOFF : close alone is enough.")
waitClose = input.bool(false, "Wait For Bar Close",      group = gSig)

gAct = "═════  UNIVERSAL ACTIVITY ENGINE  ═════"
volSrc    = input.string("Auto", "Activity Source", options = ["Auto", "Chart Volume Only", "External Symbol", "Synthetic Estimate"], group = gAct, tooltip = "Auto = real chart volume if the feed has it, else the external symbol if set, else the synthetic estimate. This keeps flow and gauge working on every market.")
extSym    = input.symbol("", "External Volume Symbol", group = gAct, tooltip = "Optional. Point this at a venue that publishes volume for the same asset, e.g. a futures contract or a major exchange pair.")
synthLen  = input.int(20, "Synthetic Baseline ATR", minval = 5, maxval = 100, group = gAct)
showPanel = input.bool(true, "Show Info Panel", group = gAct)

gVol = "═════  FLOW OVERLAY  ═════"
showVol   = input.bool(true, "Show Flow Inside Channel", group = gVol)
volMode   = input.string("Comparison", "Flow Mode", options = ["Comparison", "Total", "Delta"], group = gVol)
volFill   = input.float(0.85, "Flow Column Height", minval = 0.1, maxval = 1, step = 0.05, group = gVol)
volWidth  = input.int(2,      "Flow Column Width",  minval = 1, maxval = 6, group = gVol)
volCap    = input.int(90,     "Max Flow Columns / Channel", minval = 10, maxval = 300, group = gVol)
showTag   = input.bool(true,  "Show Buy/Sell Tag",  group = gVol)

gGa = "═════  PRESSURE GAUGE  ═════"
showGauge = input.bool(true, "Show Pressure Gauge", group = gGa)
gaugeOff  = input.int(12, "Gauge Offset (bars)", minval = 2, maxval = 60, group = gGa)
gaugeW    = input.int(3,  "Gauge Width (bars)",  minval = 1, maxval = 15, group = gGa)

gSty = "═════  STYLE  ═════"
colBox    = input.color(color.new(color.gray, 85), "Channel Body", group = gSty, inline = "s1")
colBrd    = input.color(color.new(color.gray, 45), "Border",       group = gSty, inline = "s1")
colTop    = input.color(color.new(#ef5350,    70), "Upper Edge",   group = gSty, inline = "s2")
colBot    = input.color(color.new(#26a69a,    70), "Lower Edge",   group = gSty, inline = "s2")
colMid    = input.color(color.new(color.gray, 20), "Equilibrium",  group = gSty)
colBull   = input.color(#26e2a8, "Bullish", group = gSty, inline = "s3")
colBear   = input.color(#f6465d, "Bearish", group = gSty, inline = "s3")
colTxt    = input.color(color.white, "Channel Tag Text", group = gSty)
panelBg   = input.color(#d90429, "Info Panel Background", group = gSty)
panelTx   = input.color(color.white, "Info Panel Text", group = gSty)

// preset resolution
compThr = preset == "High" ? 55 : preset == "Medium" ? 62 : preset == "Low" ? 72 : compThrIn
minBars = preset == "High" ? 6  : preset == "Medium" ? 9  : preset == "Low" ? 14 : minBarsIn

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  T Y P E S
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
type Zone
    box         body
    box         upz
    box         dnz
    line        mid
    label       tag
    array<line> flow
    float       buy
    float       sell
    float       scale
    bool        live

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  H E L P E R S
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
fmtVol(float v) =>
    string s = "N/A"
    if not na(v)
        av = math.abs(v)
        s := av >= 1e9 ? str.tostring(v / 1e9, "#.##") + "B" : av >= 1e6 ? str.tostring(v / 1e6, "#.##") + "M" : av >= 1e3 ? str.tostring(v / 1e3, "#.#") + "K" : str.tostring(v, "#.#")
    s

method wipe(Zone z) =>
    box.delete(z.body)
    box.delete(z.upz)
    box.delete(z.dnz)
    line.delete(z.mid)
    label.delete(z.tag)
    if not na(z.flow)
        if z.flow.size() > 0
            for ln in z.flow
                line.delete(ln)
            z.flow.clear()

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  U N I V E R S A L   A C T I V I T Y   E N G I N E
//  Resolves a usable per-bar activity series on ANY symbol and ANY timeframe.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// (a) real chart volume
float  rawVol  = nz(volume)
bool   hasReal = ta.cum(rawVol) > 0 and not na(volume)

// (b) external reference symbol
string reqSym  = extSym == "" ? syminfo.tickerid : extSym
float  extRaw  = request.security(reqSym, timeframe.period, volume, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
float  extVol  = nz(extRaw)
bool   hasExt  = extSym != "" and ta.cum(extVol) > 0

// (c) synthetic activity proxy — original construction
float trueR    = ta.tr(true)
float baseATR  = ta.atr(synthLen)
float bodyEff  = trueR > 0 ? math.abs(close - open) / trueR : 0.0
float rangeAct = baseATR > 0 ? trueR / baseATR : 1.0
float synthVol = math.max(0.0, rangeAct * (0.55 + 0.45 * bodyEff) * 1000.0)

// resolution
string actName = "Synthetic (estimated)"
float  actVol  = synthVol
if volSrc == "Chart Volume Only"
    actVol  := rawVol
    actName := hasReal ? "Chart volume (real)" : "Chart volume (empty)"
else if volSrc == "External Symbol"
    actVol  := extVol
    actName := hasExt ? "External symbol (real)" : "External symbol (empty)"
else if volSrc == "Synthetic Estimate"
    actVol  := synthVol
    actName := "Synthetic (estimated)"
else
    if hasReal
        actVol  := rawVol
        actName := "Chart volume (real)"
    else if hasExt
        actVol  := extVol
        actName := "External symbol (real)"
    else
        actVol  := synthVol
        actName := "Synthetic (estimated)"

bool actLive = ta.cum(actVol) > 0
bool useFlow = showVol and actLive

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  C O M P R E S S I O N   I N D E X   ( original composite )
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
llv        = ta.lowest(low,  normLen)
hhv        = ta.highest(high, normLen)
span       = hhv - llv
normPos    = span > 0 ? (close - llv) / span : 0.5
dispersion = ta.stdev(normPos, dispLen)
dispRank   = ta.percentrank(dispersion, rankLen)

atr14      = ta.atr(14)
atrFast    = ta.atr(atrFastL)
atrSlow    = ta.atr(atrSlowL)
volRatio   = atrSlow > 0 ? atrFast / atrSlow : 1.0
ratioRank  = ta.percentrank(volRatio, rankLen)

compIndex  = 100.0 - (nz(dispRank, 50) * dispW + nz(ratioRank, 50) * (1.0 - dispW))
squeezeNow = compIndex >= compThr

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  S Q U E E Z E   S T A T E   M A C H I N E
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var bool inSqueeze = false
var int  sqLen     = 0
bool     released  = false
int      sqBars    = 0

if squeezeNow
    if inSqueeze
        sqLen += 1
    else
        inSqueeze := true
        sqLen     := 1
else
    if inSqueeze
        inSqueeze := false
        if sqLen >= minBars
            released := true
            sqBars   := math.min(sqLen, maxBars)
        sqLen := 0

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  S T O R A G E
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var array<Zone> zones = array.new<Zone>()
var array<box>  gauge = array.new<box>()
var label       gPtr  = na
var table       panel = na

bool bullBreak = false
bool bearBreak = false

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  F L O W   C O L U M N   D R A W I N G
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
method drawFlow(Zone z, int x, float bv, float sv) =>
    if useFlow and not na(z.scale) and z.scale > 0
        float eq = (box.get_top(z.body) + box.get_bottom(z.body)) / 2.0
        if volMode == "Comparison"
            z.flow.push(line.new(x, eq, x, eq + bv * z.scale, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = color.new(colBull, 30), width = volWidth))
            z.flow.push(line.new(x, eq, x, eq - sv * z.scale, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = color.new(colBear, 30), width = volWidth))
        else if volMode == "Total"
            float tv = bv + sv
            color  c = bv >= sv ? colBull : colBear
            z.flow.push(line.new(x, eq, x, eq + tv * z.scale / 2.0, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = color.new(c, 35), width = volWidth))
            z.flow.push(line.new(x, eq, x, eq - tv * z.scale / 2.0, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = color.new(c, 35), width = volWidth))
        else
            float dv = bv - sv
            color  c = dv >= 0 ? colBull : colBear
            z.flow.push(line.new(x, eq, x, eq + dv * z.scale, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = color.new(c, 25), width = volWidth))

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  C H A N N E L   C R E A T I O N   ( retroactive over the finished squeeze )
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
if released and showCh
    float top  = na
    float bot  = na
    float maxB = 0.0
    float maxS = 0.0
    float sumB = 0.0
    float sumS = 0.0

    for i = 1 to sqBars
        float hi = high[i]
        float lo = low[i]
        top := na(top) ? hi : math.max(top, hi)
        bot := na(bot) ? lo : math.min(bot, lo)
        float rg = hi - lo
        float vv = nz(actVol[i])
        float bv = rg > 0 ? vv * (close[i] - lo) / rg : vv * 0.5
        float sv = vv - bv
        sumB += bv
        sumS += sv
        maxB := math.max(maxB, bv)
        maxS := math.max(maxS, sv)

    if not na(top) and not na(bot) and top > bot
        float rng  = top - bot
        float zh   = math.min(nz(atr14, rng * 0.1) * zoneMult, rng * zoneCap)
        float midP = (top + bot) / 2.0
        int   xL   = math.max(0, bar_index - sqBars)
        int   xR   = bar_index

        Zone z = Zone.new()
        z.body := box.new(xL, top, xR, bot, border_color = colBrd, border_width = 1, bgcolor = colBox)
        z.upz  := box.new(xL, top, xR, top - zh, border_color = color.new(color.white, 100), bgcolor = colTop)
        z.dnz  := box.new(xL, bot + zh, xR, bot, border_color = color.new(color.white, 100), bgcolor = colBot)
        if showMid
            z.mid := line.new(xL, midP, xR, midP, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = colMid, style = line.style_dashed, width = 1)
        z.flow := array.new<line>()
        z.buy  := sumB
        z.sell := sumS
        z.live := true

        float peak  = math.max(maxB, maxS)
        float denom = volMode == "Total" ? maxB + maxS : peak
        z.scale := denom > 0 ? (rng / 2.0) * volFill / denom : na

        if showTag
            z.tag := label.new(xL + int(sqBars / 2), top - zh, fmtVol(z.buy) + " / " + fmtVol(z.sell), xloc = xloc.bar_index, style = label.style_label_down, color = color.new(color.black, 100), textcolor = colTxt, size = size.tiny)

        if useFlow
            int step = math.max(1, int(math.ceil(sqBars / math.max(1.0, volCap))))
            for i = sqBars to 1
                if (sqBars - i) % step == 0
                    float hi = high[i]
                    float lo = low[i]
                    float rg = hi - lo
                    float vv = nz(actVol[i])
                    float bv = rg > 0 ? vv * (close[i] - lo) / rg : vv * 0.5
                    z.drawFlow(bar_index - i, bv, vv - bv)

        zones.push(z)

        while zones.size() > maxKeep
            Zone old = zones.shift()
            old.wipe()

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  L I V E   C H A N N E L   M A N A G E M E N T   +   B R E A K O U T S
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
float probe   = strongOn ? math.avg(close, open) : close
bool  canFire = waitClose ? barstate.isconfirmed : true

if zones.size() > 0
    for i = zones.size() - 1 to 0
        Zone z = zones.get(i)
        if z.live
            float t = box.get_top(z.body)
            float b = box.get_bottom(z.body)

            if canFire and probe > t
                z.live := false
                bullBreak := true
                if showArr
                    label.new(bar_index, b, "▲", xloc = xloc.bar_index, style = label.style_label_center, color = colBull, textcolor = color.black, size = size.small)
                if not keepBrk
                    z.wipe()
                    zones.remove(i)

            else if canFire and probe < b
                z.live := false
                bearBreak := true
                if showArr
                    label.new(bar_index, t, "▼", xloc = xloc.bar_index, style = label.style_label_center, color = colBear, textcolor = color.black, size = size.small)
                if not keepBrk
                    z.wipe()
                    zones.remove(i)

            else
                // still trapped inside the pocket → extend the channel
                box.set_right(z.body, bar_index)
                box.set_right(z.upz,  bar_index)
                box.set_right(z.dnz,  bar_index)
                if not na(z.mid)
                    line.set_x2(z.mid, bar_index)

                if barstate.isconfirmed and actLive
                    float rg = high - low
                    float bv = rg > 0 ? actVol * (close - low) / rg : actVol * 0.5
                    float sv = actVol - bv
                    z.buy  := nz(z.buy)  + bv
                    z.sell := nz(z.sell) + sv
                    if useFlow and z.flow.size() < volCap * 2
                        z.drawFlow(bar_index, bv, sv)
                    if not na(z.tag)
                        label.set_text(z.tag, fmtVol(z.buy) + " / " + fmtVol(z.sell))

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  P R E S S U R E   G A U G E
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
float livePos  = na
float liveTop  = na
float liveBot  = na

if barstate.islast
    if gauge.size() > 0
        for gb in gauge
            box.delete(gb)
        gauge.clear()
    label.delete(gPtr)

    if zones.size() > 0
        Zone gz = zones.get(zones.size() - 1)
        if gz.live
            float t = box.get_top(gz.body)
            float b = box.get_bottom(gz.body)
            liveTop := t
            liveBot := b

            float pos  = 0.5
            float dTot = nz(gz.buy) + nz(gz.sell)
            if actLive and dTot > 0
                pos := math.max(0.0, math.min(1.0, 0.5 + 0.5 * ((gz.buy - gz.sell) / dTot)))
            livePos := pos

            if showGauge
                int   x1 = bar_index + gaugeOff
                int   x2 = x1 + gaugeW
                int   segs = 24
                float stp = (t - b) / segs
                for s = 0 to segs - 1
                    float y1 = b + stp * s
                    float y2 = y1 + stp
                    color cg = color.from_gradient(s, 0, segs - 1, colBear, colBull)
                    gauge.push(box.new(x1, y2, x2, y1, border_color = color.new(color.white, 100), bgcolor = color.new(cg, 35)))
                gPtr := label.new(x2, b + (t - b) * pos, "◀ " + str.tostring(pos * 100, "#") + "%", xloc = xloc.bar_index, style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(color.black, 100), textcolor = color.from_gradient(pos, 0, 1, colBear, colBull), size = size.small)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  I N F O   P A N E L
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
if barstate.islast and showPanel
    table.delete(panel)
    panel := table.new(position.top_right, 2, 6, border_width = 1, border_color = color.new(color.white, 75), frame_width = 1, frame_color = color.new(color.white, 65))
    color bgH = color.new(panelBg, 0)
    color bgC = color.new(panelBg, 18)

    table.cell(panel, 0, 0, "LIQUIDITY BREAKOUT MATRIX", bgcolor = bgH, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 0, "LBM", bgcolor = bgH, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)

    table.cell(panel, 0, 1, "Activity Source", bgcolor = bgC, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 1, actName, bgcolor = bgC, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)

    table.cell(panel, 0, 2, "Compression", bgcolor = bgC, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 2, str.tostring(compIndex, "#.#") + " / 100", bgcolor = bgC, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)

    table.cell(panel, 0, 3, "State", bgcolor = bgC, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 3, inSqueeze ? "Coiling  (" + str.tostring(sqLen) + " bars)" : "Expanding", bgcolor = bgC, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)

    table.cell(panel, 0, 4, "Active Channel", bgcolor = bgC, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 4, na(liveTop) ? "none" : str.tostring(liveBot, format.mintick) + " – " + str.tostring(liveTop, format.mintick), bgcolor = bgC, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)

    table.cell(panel, 0, 5, "Pressure", bgcolor = bgC, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 5, na(livePos) ? "—" : str.tostring(livePos * 100, "#") + "% buyers", bgcolor = bgC, text_color = panelTx, text_size = size.tiny)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  A L E R T S
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
alertcondition(bullBreak, "LBM • Bullish Breakout", "Liquidity Breakout Matrix: price resolved ABOVE the channel on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(bearBreak, "LBM • Bearish Breakout", "Liquidity Breakout Matrix: price resolved BELOW the channel on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(released,  "LBM • New Channel",      "Liquidity Breakout Matrix: a new consolidation channel has been mapped on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")

if bullBreak
    alert("LBM Bullish Breakout — " + syminfo.ticker + " " + timeframe.period, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if bearBreak
    alert("LBM Bearish Breakout — " + syminfo.ticker + " " + timeframe.period, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  D A T A   W I N D O W   O U T P U T S
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
plot(compIndex,        "Compression Index", color = color.new(color.orange, 100), display = display.data_window)
plot(inSqueeze ? 1 : 0,"Squeeze Active",    color = color.new(color.orange, 100), display = display.data_window)
plot(actVol,           "Resolved Activity", color = color.new(color.orange, 100), display = display.data_window)